  "title": "merge: Add merge comment",
  "description": "The merge code tries to add a comment about what file names\nare part of the merge. However, it's been doing so by appending\nthat comment information to the first comment in the first SHB\nof the first source file, and doing nothing if there isn't an\nexisting comment.\n\nEnsure that the comment is always there by adding the comment\ninstead. Perhaps it should be prepended instead.\n\nFix #13839",
